{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>היקום אשר עשיתי</b> — in gematria: לא חיים (not alive), for the revival of the dead." "<b>היקום</b> — three times in the Masorah: ומחיתי את כל היקום · וימח את כל היקום · ואת כל היקום אשר ברגליהם — to say: just as the generation of the Flood sinned because of the abundance of goodness and wealth they had, so too Korah, because of the abundance of wealth he had, sought to dominate and sinned."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:46.803998902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}